  "caveats": [
    "Operator-selection LP uses a DIAGONAL Frobenius Gram G_ij = δ_ij·|V̂_i|² as a tractable approximation; the full G_ij = tr_M(σ_i σ_j) from Hoefsmit seminormal would tighten the LP relaxation. Primal-dual structure (which operators are active) is informative under the diagonal approximation; absolute primal_obj values are only indicative.",
    "Pair-knot composite volume uses the simple product |V̂_pair| = ∏_{i ∈ shell} |V̂_i| (Hopf-link / categorical-product convention). Alternative conventions (geometric mean, single-Φ_q evaluation on the composite Hecke generator product, full Markov-trace of σ_pp = σ_0 σ_1 σ_3 σ_4) are not yet probed."
